WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.630
On Home, choose 1. Add API connection, then New Connection.

2
00:00:06.630 --> 00:00:10.630
Give it a name and choose OpenRouter as the provider.

3
00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:16.570
Paste your own API key. It stays masked; OpenRouter uses its provider URL automatically.

4
00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:23.320
Refresh models, type to filter, then select a model. Here we use Free Models Router.

5
00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:29.320
Choose Create, then click the saved connection’s name to make it active.

6
00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:33.320
Open its More actions menu (⋮) and choose Test connection.

7
00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:38.420
Connection successful confirms that OpenRouter accepted the saved key.
